{"sha": "6d04c4ccaf7f30d995987a218cf444bab2a27a403fa40934578c3efa43b57675", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "同样由回路定律，无电源；再次代入：", "$RC(-U_0/\\tau)e^{-t/\\tau} + U_0 e^{-t/\\tau} = 0$，且 $u(0) = U_0$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=9.2cm, height=5.4cm, xlabel={$t$}, ylabel={$u$},", "    xmin=0, xmax=5, ymin=0, ymax=7.4, xtick={0,1,2,3,4,5},", "    xticklabels={$0$,$\\tau$,$2\\tau$,$3\\tau$,$4\\tau$,$5\\tau$},", "    ytick={0,2.21,3.79,6.0},", "    yticklabels={$0$,$0.37\\,\\mathcal{E}$,$0.63\\,\\mathcal{E}$,$\\mathcal{E}$}]", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0:5, samples=2] {6};", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0:1.18, samples=2] {6*x};", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0:1.1, samples=2] {6-6*x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:5, samples=80] {6*(1-exp(-x))};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:5, samples=80] {6*exp(-x)};", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (1,0) -- (1,3.79) -- (0,3.79);", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] (3,0) -- (3,5.70);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 充电（蓝色，自 $u = 0$ 趋向 $\\mathcal{E}$）与", "放电（红色，自 $U_0 = \\mathcal{E}$）。两条初切线均", "在 $t = \\tau$ 处与各自渐近线相交；$63\\%$ 于 $\\tau$ 时完成，$95\\%$ 于 $3\\tau$ 时完成。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[闪光灯的数据]\\label{ex:g12:rc-rl-circuits:flashrc}", "相机闪光灯的电容器 $C = \\qty{800}{\\micro F}$ 经", "$R = \\qty{1.0}{k\\ohm}$: $\\tau = 10^3 \\times 8.0\\times10^{-4} =", "\\qty{0.80}{s}$，故“就绪”指示灯接线设定在 $95\\%$ 时动作 ---", "需等待 $3\\tau \\approx \\qty{2.4}{s}$：这便是等待时的嗡嗡声。", "经闪光管放电时，仅有 \\qty{0.50}{\\ohm} 的电阻，\\emph{同一}", "电容器以 $\\tau' = \\qty{0.40}{ms}$ 放空，", "比充电快两千倍。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{线圈：电感与 RL 电路}", "", "\\begin{definition}[电感器与电感]\\label{def:g12:rc-rl-circuits:inductor}", "称\\emph{电感器}\\index{电感器}为一圈导线绕成的线圈，其电流", "在自身各匝中产生磁场", "（见\\cref{ch:g11:magnetic-fields}）；只要它\\emph{变化}，线圈两端", "便会出现电压：", "\\[", "u = L\\,\\frac{di}{dt} .", "\\]", "常量 $L$ 称为\\emph{电感}\\index{电感}，单位为", "\\emph{亨利}\\index{亨利}（\\unit{H}）：$\\qty{1}{H} = \\qty{1}{V.s/A}$。", "\\end{definition}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{remark}[线圈阻碍变化]\\label{rem:g12:rc-rl-circuits:oppose}", "变化的电流为何产生电压 --- 即电磁感应 --- 在", "大学分册中推导；这里仅取定律及其性质：线圈", "\\emph{阻碍}其电流的变化。两者可作对照：电容器的", "$u$ 不能跃变，线圈的 $i$ 也不能跃变。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{circuitikz}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,0) to[battery1, l=$\\mathcal{E}$] (0,2.4) to[nos, l=$K$] (2.1,2.4)", "    to[R=$R$] (4.2,2.4) -- (5.4,2.4) to[L=$L$, i=$i$, v=$u$] (5.4,0) -- (0,0);", "\\end{circuitikz}", "", "{\\small RL 电路：开关 $K$ 闭合后，线圈使电流", "只能按自身节奏上升，时间常数 $\\tau = L/R$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[RL 电路中的电流上升]\\label{prop:g12:rc-rl-circuits:rl}", "\\index{RL 电路}", "闭合开关，使电源 $\\mathcal{E}$、电阻器 $R$", "与线圈 $L$ 串联，得 $\\mathcal{E} = Ri + L\\,di/dt$，即", "\\[", "\\frac{L}{R}\\,\\frac{di}{dt} + i = \\frac{\\mathcal{E}}{R},", "\\qquad\\text{其解为}\\quad", "i(t) = \\frac{\\mathcal{E}}{R}\\left(1 - e^{-t/\\tau}\\right),", "\\quad \\tau = \\frac{L}{R} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "同样由回路定律，它与\\emph{同一方程}一致，", "即\\cref{thm:g12:rc-rl-circuits:charging} 中的方程，令 $u \\to i$，", "$\\mathcal{E} \\to \\mathcal{E}/R$，$RC \\to L/R$；同一代换也验证其解，", "凡是", "\\cref{met:g12:rc-rl-circuits:reading}中的读法均可移用。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[电磁铁开始工作]\\label{ex:g12:rc-rl-circuits:rl}", "一只继电器线圈，$L = \\qty{0.30}{H}$ 与 $R = \\qty{6.0}{\\ohm}$，接在", "\\qty{12}{V} 电源上：终态电流 $\\mathcal{E}/R = \\qty{2.0}{A}$，电流按", "$\\tau = 0.30/6.0 = \\qty{50}{ms}$ 的节奏上升 --- 约在 $3\\tau \\approx", "\\qty{0.15}{s}$ 时工作。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[断开开关时的火花]\\label{rem:g12:rc-rl-circuits:spark}", "在通电线圈上断开开关，$i$ 必须在", "不到一毫秒内骤降为零：$di/dt$ 极大，$u = L\\,di/dt$ 可达数百", "甚至数千伏特 --- 火花会跨过触点。汽车点火", "线圈正是有意如此，每分钟数千次。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{储存的能量}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[电容器中的能量与线圈中的能量]\\label{prop:g12:rc-rl-circuits:energy}", "\\index{能量!电容器中的}\\index{能量!线圈中的}", "电容器 $C$ 充电至电压 $u$，线圈 $L$ 通有电流", "$i$ 时，所储存的能量为", "\\[", "E_C = \\tfrac12\\,C u^2 = \\frac{q^2}{2C},", "\\qquad", "E_L = \\tfrac12\\,L i^2 .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}